CERTORA VERIFICATION MUNGE — migrate-loop redeem seam
=====================================================
The per-position redeem inside `_migratePositions` calls `_redeemIfResolved`
directly, but that function is `private` and therefore cannot be overridden by a
verification harness. This munge inserts an `internal virtual` pass-through,
`_redeemIfResolvedDuringMigrate`, and routes ONLY the loop call site through it;
`resolveMigrationCondition` keeps calling `_redeemIfResolved` directly.

Why the seam is scoped to the loop only:
  - The migrate loop unrolls `_redeemIfResolvedDuringMigrate` `loop_iter` times.
    Its real body (legacy `payoutNumerators` reads, the `p0 * D / den` division,
    the legacy redeem and the vault settle) is what makes both `migratePositions`
    overloads diverge / time out in the solver.
  - `BinaryModuleHarness` / `NegRiskModuleHarness` override THIS wrapper with a
    sound over-approximation that drops the legacy plumbing but keeps the
    resolution store (gated by `_useMigrateRedeemModel()`, default false).
  - `resolveMigrationCondition` still calls `_redeemIfResolved`, so its real body
    is preserved — over-approximating it there would make its resolved/preserved
    case VACUOUS. That regression is the exact reason the override is scoped to
    the loop.

Production is behavior-identical: the wrapper is a straight pass-through and no
production module overrides it. The munge is required to COMPILE the two module
harnesses (their `_redeemIfResolvedDuringMigrate ... override` needs a base
`virtual`), so it must be applied for every Binary / NegRisk conf, not just the
Solvency02 specs whose overrides are actually active.

Required by: every Binary-* and NegRisk-* conf (they compile BinaryModuleHarness /
NegRiskModuleHarness). The active overrides are consumed by Binary-Solvency02 and
NegRisk-Solvency02 (via `_useMigrateRedeemModel() => ALWAYS(true)`).
Apply:  git apply certora/patches/BaseMigrationMixin_migrateRedeemSeam.patch
Revert: git apply -R certora/patches/BaseMigrationMixin_migrateRedeemSeam.patch
Never commit the applied state to src/.

